      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: startOfGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: D-2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: I found myself imagining a certain scenario.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: If I ever stepped outside this shipping container, what could I possibly
        do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Thinking about it sent me into overload mode, and my components started
        to heat up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: I've always done my job here, of course. It's the perfect place for
        a robot to work alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: Was it because I liked it here? Because I was content with this endless
        routine?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: What if... it was simply because I was afraid of what lay beyond this
        container?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: Ah, my components are heating up again...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: startOfGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: D-2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: "\uBB38\uB4DD \uC774\uB7F0 \uC0C1\uD669\uC744 \uAC00\uC815\uD574\uBD24\uC5B4\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "\uC81C\uAC00 \uC774 \uCEE8\uD14C\uC774\uB108 \uBC15\uC2A4 \uBC16\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB098\uAC04\uB2E4\uBA74, \uC800\uB294 \uBB58 \uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\uADF8\uB807\uAC8C \uC0DD\uAC01\uD558\uB2C8\uAE4C, \uACFC\uBD80\uD654\uBAA8\uB4DC\uC5D0
        \uC9C4\uC785\uD558\uC5EC \uBD80\uD488\uB4E4\uC774 \uB728\uAC70\uC6CC\uC84C\uC5B4\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\uC800\uB294 \uC904\uACE7 \uB2F9\uC5F0\uD788 \uC774\uACF3\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uC784\uBB34\uB97C \uB2E4\uD588\uC5B4\uC694, \uD640\uB85C \uC791\uC5C5\uD558\uAE30
        \uB531 \uC801\uB2F9\uD55C \uACF5\uAC04\uC774\uC8E0."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\uC774\uACF3\uC774 \uC88B\uC544\uC11C, \uC774\uB7F0 \uBC18\uBCF5\uC5D0
        \uB9CC\uC871\uD574\uC11C \uADF8\uB7AC\uB358 \uAC78\uAE4C\uC694?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: "\uB9CC\uC57D\uC5D0 ... \uADF8\uB0E5 \uC774 \uCEE8\uD14C\uC774\uB108
        \uBC15\uC2A4 \uBC14\uAE65\uC774 \uB450\uB824\uC6CC\uC11C \uADF8\uB7AC\uB358
        \uAC70\uB77C\uBA74\uC694?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "\uC544, \uBD80\uD488\uB4E4\uC774 \uB610 \uB728\uAC70\uC6CC\uC9C0\uACE0
        \uC788\uC5B4\uC694..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6289247631775507956, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: BridgeTemplate
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects:
    - {fileID: 7515301378082972448, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
